{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold On is a lighthearted adventure game about persistence, mistakes, and one very demanding goose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve got one job: make sure the delivery arrives. Sounds simple? Think again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore cozy environments, interact with quirky objects, and overcome silly obstacles as you track down a missing package. The goose won\u2019t wait forever\u2014so hold on, retrace your steps, and maybe even laugh at yourself along the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022640/extras/c2445bd20cf5d7aaee1762b43ea38aca.avif?t=1758895018\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udda2 A goose that won\u2019t take excuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 A delivery that never seems to stay put.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Small but charming environments to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude02 Light puzzle-solving and comedic frustration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Relaxed atmosphere with playful twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022640/extras/905dbe605983c49ab92de521b7aee682.avif?t=1758895018\" width=748 height=896 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022640?t=1758895018","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022640?t=1758895018","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022640/1223b1ca8f9dcc9d4e20300eaab2837f21435780/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758895018","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com